    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our discord</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/3d447347eeac2b5bcea0021fb46a8eeb.avif?t=1728527818\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve crimes according to the plot of suspense </h2></strong><br>The story takes place in the Tang Dynasty, following the rich and suspenseful main plot, collect evidence, solve the case questions<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/c507e76302417113041f850b357a4eeb.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/c507e76302417113041f850b357a4eeb.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/c507e76302417113041f850b357a4eeb.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Building the ancient city from scratch</h2></strong><br>To clear the wilderness and cultivate the land, build and decorate hundreds of kinds of buildings, install new houses, build Bridges and roads, solve the problem of food, clothing, housing and transportation for the people, and operate a paradise on earth.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/6cb67a91e3cf9bc77f568600333d29d4.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/6cb67a91e3cf9bc77f568600333d29d4.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/6cb67a91e3cf9bc77f568600333d29d4.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reasonable arrangement of production plan and personnel</h2></strong><br>Collecting natural resources, planning production properly and adapting to local conditions can make it easier! There is also a need to humanize the arrangement of personnel, take care of everyone's emotions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/7697793cd6845872b354f4fe5ddf0e58.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/7697793cd6845872b354f4fe5ddf0e58.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/7697793cd6845872b354f4fe5ddf0e58.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather clues, explore strange cases</h2></strong><br>Every day to deal with the official responsible for government affairs, collect criminal evidence, trial criminals, to protect everyone's safety.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/d18f3c816dfa3b068aaba60b22339761.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/d18f3c816dfa3b068aaba60b22339761.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/d18f3c816dfa3b068aaba60b22339761.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet all kinds of interesting people</h2></strong><br>There are a lot of interesting people in this town, and everyone important has a lot of information. Try to get to know them, and you will get a lot of surprises.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/a6a4feb0eb461afb9c4a299f32950412.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/a6a4feb0eb461afb9c4a299f32950412.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/a6a4feb0eb461afb9c4a299f32950412.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
