itions can make it easier! There is also a need to humanize the arrangement of personnel, take care of everyone's emotions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/7697793cd6845872b354f4fe5ddf0e58.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/7697793cd6845872b354f4fe5ddf0e58.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/7697793cd6845872b354f4fe5ddf0e58.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather clues, explore strange cases</h2></strong><br>Every day to deal with the official responsible for government affairs, collect criminal evidence, trial criminals, to protect everyone's safety.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/d18f3c816dfa3b068aaba60b22339761.poster.avif?t=1728527818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/d18f3c816dfa3b068aaba60b22339761.webm?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/d18f3c816dfa3b068aaba60b22339761.mp4?t=1728527818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet all kinds of interesting people</h2></strong><br>There are a lot of interesting people in this town, and everyone important has a lot of information. Try to get to know them, and you will get a lot of surprises.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052510/extras/